    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>6th-level Study of Fire feature</em></p><p>If you are reduced to 0 hit points, you can use your reaction to draw on the fiery energy that burns within you. You are instead reduced to 1 hit point, and each creature within 10 feet of you takes fire damage equal to half your mage level + your Intelligence modifier.</p><p>Once you use this feature, you can’t use it again until you finish a long rest.</p>",
